ents, including behavioral rules, tool access policies, and configuration details. Shodan's index identified 1,190 hosts where these files appeared in HTTP response data or directory listings.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3\",\"children\":\"The security risk of publicly accessible agent configuration files:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-1 ml-4 mb-4 list-disc\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Tool access surface.\"}],\" Reveals what capabilities the agent has.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Decision logic.\"}],\" May expose authorization rules and guardrail implementations.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Infrastructure details.\"}],\" May reference internal service names and endpoints.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Credential exposure.\"}],\" Configuration files sometimes contain hardcoded secrets.\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-950/40 rounded p-3 text-xs text-amber-300\",\"children\":\"We recommend configuring web servers to deny access to CLAUDE.md, .claude/, and similar agent configuration paths.\"}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1c:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-white\",\"children\":\"645 MCP tool definitions exposed\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3\",\"children\":[\"The Model Context Protocol (MCP) is how AI agents connect to external tools. MCP servers expose a \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-gray-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-xs\",\"children\":\"/tools\"}],\" endpoint that lists every available tool with its parameters.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3\",\"children\":\"Shodan's cached data showed 645 hosts with MCP tool definitions visible in HTTP response headers or body content. 58 of those showed no authentication indicators in their response headers, suggesting default configurations without access controls.\"}]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-white\",\"children\":\"289 agent gateways indexed\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3\",\"children\":\"AI agent frameworks like OpenClaw use gateway servers (typically on port 18789) to manage agent sessions, tool execution, and channel integrations. Shodan indexed 289 hosts with gateway signatures on this port. 22 of those also had WebSocket control plane signatures on port 18790.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300 text-sm\",\"children\":[\"Review of OpenClaw's open source gateway code reveals that the default configuration does not require authentication. The \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-gray-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-xs\",\"children\":\"config.get\"}],\" API method, by design, returns the full configuration object, which may include integration tokens. This is a documented default behavior in the project's source code.\"]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1e:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-white\",\"children\":\"What we're doing about it\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300 text-sm mb-4\",\"children\":\"Reporting vulnerabilities without contributing fixes is incomplete work. We are doing both.\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold mb-2 text-white\",\"children\":\"Contributing upstream: OpenClaw skill code safety scanner\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3\",\"children\":[\"We submitted\",\" \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/9806\",\"className\":\"text-teal-300 hover:underline\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"children\":\"PR #9806\"}],\". A skill/plugin code safety scanner that detects dangerous patterns before they execute:\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded p-3 mb-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs space-y-1 font-mono\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"dangerous-exec\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-emerald-400\",\"children\":\"dangerous-exec\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300\",\"children\":\"child_process.exec/spawn command injection\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"dynamic-code-execution\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-emerald-400\",\"children\":\"dynamic-code-execution\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300\",\"children\":\"eval() and new Function()\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"potential-exfiltration\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-emerald-400\",\"children\":\"potential-exfiltration\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300\",\"children\":\"file read + outbound HTTP\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"env-harvesting\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-emerald-400\",\"children\":\"env-harvesting\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300\",\"children\":\"process.env access + network send\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"obfuscated-code\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-emerald-400\",\"children\":\"obfuscated-code\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300\",\"children\":\"hex-encoded strings, large base64 payloads\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"crypto-mining\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-emerald-400\",\"children\":\"crypto-mining\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300\",\"children\":\"stratum protocol indicators\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"suspicious-network\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-emerald-400\",\"children\":\"suspicious-network\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300\",\"children\":\"WebSocket to non-standard ports\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold mb-2 text-white\",\"children\":\"HackMyAgent: Scan your own infrastructure\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300 text-sm mb-3\",\"children\":\"Use HackMyAgent to audit your own AI agent infrastructure for the patterns described in this report:\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded p-3 font-mono text-xs space-y-2 mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300\",\"children\":\"# Scan your agent codebase\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"$$ npx hackmyagent secure ./my-agent-project\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300\",\"children\":\"# Test with adversarial payloads\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"$$ npx hackmyagent attack http://localhost:3000/v1/chat\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300\",\"children\":\"# Scan external infrastructure\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"$$ npx hackmyagent scan your-domain.com\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1f:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-white\",\"children\":\"Recommendations\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-300 text-sm mb-4\",\"children\":\"If you are running AI agents in production:\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-3 list-decimal ml-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Audit your network exposure.\"}],\" Run \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-gray-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-xs\",\"children\":\"hackmyagent scan your-domain.com\"}],\" to check what's reachable from the internet.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Protect CLAUDE.md and config files.\"}],\" Configure your web server to deny access to /.claude/, /CLAUDE.md, /mcp.json, /.env.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Authenticate MCP endpoints.\"}],\" Every MCP server should require authentication. An exposed /tools endpoint is an invitation to invoke your agent's capabilities.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Scan plugins before installing.\"}],\" Use static analysis to detect dangerous patterns in plugin code before execution.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Don't use dangerous config flags in production.\"}],\" Flags like \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-gray-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-xs\",\"children\":\"dangerouslyDisableDeviceAuth\"}],\" exist for local development only.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Rotate exposed credentials immediately.\"}],\" If your config files were publicly accessible, assume any credentials in them are compromised.\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"20:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"border border-gray-800 rounded p-4 mb-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://github.com/opena2a-org/hackmyagent\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-teal-300 hover:underline\",\"children\":\"GitHub\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"href\":\"/methodology\",\"className\":\"text-teal-300 hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Full Methodology\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/9806\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-teal-300 hover:underline\",\"children\":\"OpenClaw PR #9806\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://opena2a.org/blogs/state-of-ai-agent-security\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-teal-300 hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Original post on opena2a.org\"}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"21:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-gray-800 pt-6 text-xs text-gray-300\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Legal Notice:\"}],\" This research is based on analysis of data from the Shodan search engine, a publicly available internet index, combined with review of open source project documentation and default configurations. No systems were accessed, tested, or exploited. No authentication mechanisms were bypassed. No private data was retrieved or stored. All statistics represent aggregate analysis of publicly indexed information.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"Responsible Disclosure:\"}],\" If you believe your infrastructure is affected by the patterns described here, we encourage you to audit your own systems. Contact \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"mailto:[email withheld by Lighthouse]\",\"className\":\"text-teal-300 hover:underline\",\"children\":\"[email withhe